Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.30,0:00:03.10,Top,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}{\i1}[Golden hour. His son is home after two years.]{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.30,0:00:06.30,Top,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}{\i1}[Dad holds on a little longer than his son does]{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.50,0:00:09.50,Top,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}{\i1}[That evening. Dad shyly holds out his phone]{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.70,0:00:13.50,Top,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}{\i1}[The son doesn't look up from his laptop]{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.70,0:00:17.50,Top,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}{\i1}[Dad smiles it off. But it stings.]{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.80,0:00:21.50,Top,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}{\i1}[Late night. Dad tries the phone alone]{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.70,0:00:25.90,Top,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}{\i1}[He tucks his son in, and takes a photo]{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.10,0:00:29.90,Top,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}{\i1}[Morning. Dad hoping for just one more day]{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.10,0:00:33.90,Top,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}{\i1}[Dad keeps waving long after the car is gone]{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.10,0:00:36.90,Top,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}{\i1}[Weeks later. Dad keeps calling. The son flips his phone over]{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.10,0:00:43.90,Top,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}{\i1}[Messages from Mom]{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.10,0:00:47.90,Top,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}{\i1}[It finally sinks in]{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.10,0:00:51.90,Top,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}{\i1}[Rain. Dad's chair sits empty.]{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.10,0:00:55.90,Top,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}{\i1}[After the funeral. Dad's glasses and phone]{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.10,0:01:00.60,Top,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}{\i1}[Dad's drafts. Every one addressed to him]{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.70,0:01:05.90,Top,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}{\i1}[Not one of them was ever sent]{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.10,0:01:10.90,Top,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}{\i1}[He breaks down]{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.10,0:01:15.90,Top,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}{\i1}[Years later. In his dad's shirt and chair]{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.10,0:01:22.90,Top,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}{\i1}[This time, he puts the laptop away]{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.10,0:01:27.80,Top,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}{\i1}[He holds his boy close]{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.60,0:00:03.10,Mid,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}His son came home for the first time in two years.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.90,0:00:09.40,Mid,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}DAD: {\i1}(hopeful){\i0} Son… how do I send a photo?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.90,0:00:11.80,Mid,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}SON: {\i1}(not looking up){\i0} I showed you already, Dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.00,0:00:13.50,Mid,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}DAD: {\i1}(quietly){\i0} Right… okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.00,0:00:17.30,Mid,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}{\i1}[clock ticking]{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.00,0:00:21.30,Mid,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Later that night, he tried on his own.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.20,0:00:25.60,Mid,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}{\i1}[camera shutter clicks]{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.50,0:00:28.10,Mid,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}DAD: {\i1}(gently){\i0} Stay one more day?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.30,0:00:29.90,Mid,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}SON: {\i1}(rushed){\i0} Can't, Dad. Big week.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.40,0:00:33.60,Mid,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}{\i1}[engine starts, car drives away]{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.30,0:00:47.60,Mid,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}{\i1}[breath catches]{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.30,0:00:51.60,Mid,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}{\i1}[rain, distant thunder]{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.30,0:01:10.60,Mid,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}{\i1}[quiet sobbing]{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.30,0:01:13.00,Mid,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Years later.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.40,0:01:15.90,Mid,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}BOY: {\i1}(excited){\i0} Dad, how do I send a photo?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.00,0:01:19.60,Mid,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}He wasn't learning the phone.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.80,0:01:22.80,Mid,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}He was trying to reach you.
